<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>SAV → HSV 내륙운송 L/T 분석 보고 | 부품기획팀</title>
<style>
  :root{
    --pt:#C10933;
    --pt-soft:#F6E3E8;
    --pt-line:#EBC7D0;
    --ink:#1A1A1A;
    --ink2:#5C5C5C;
    --ink3:#9E9E9E;
    --line:#E6E6E6;
    --blue:#1A4F8A;
    --amber:#B45309;
    --green:#1A7340;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0;}
  html,body{height:100%;}
  body{
    background:#F2F2F2;
    font-family:"Malgun Gothic","맑은 고딕","Apple SD Gothic Neo",
                "Noto Sans KR",-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,sans-serif;
    color:var(--ink);
    overflow:hidden;
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  }
  #viewport{position:relative;width:100vw;height:100vh;overflow:hidden;}
  #stage{
    position:absolute;top:50%;left:50%;
    width:1280px;height:720px;
    transform-origin:center center;
    background:#FFFFFF;
    box-shadow:0 10px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.18);
  }
  .slide{
    position:absolute;inset:0;
    padding:34px 46px 46px 46px;
    opacity:0;visibility:hidden;
    transition:opacity .28s ease;
    display:flex;flex-direction:column;
  }
  .slide.active{opacity:1;visibility:visible;}

  /* ---------- header ---------- */
  .hd{border-bottom:2px solid var(--pt);padding-bottom:9px;margin-bottom:16px;
      display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:space-between;flex:0 0 auto;}
  .hd h1{font-size:25px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.5px;}
  .hd h1 .sub{color:var(--pt);}
  .hd .meta{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--ink3);padding-bottom:3px;letter-spacing:.2px;}
  .eyebrow{font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:2.4px;color:var(--pt);font-weight:700;margin-bottom:5px;}

  .body{flex:1 1 auto;min-height:0;}
  .cols{display:grid;gap:18px;height:100%;}
  .c-2{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;}
  .c-2a{grid-template-columns:1.35fr 1fr;}
  .c-2b{grid-template-columns:1fr 1.25fr;}
  .c-3{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);}
  .c-4{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);}
  .stack{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;min-height:0;}

  .sec-t{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:var(--pt);margin-bottom:8px;
         display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;}
  .sec-t::before{content:"";width:4px;height:13px;background:var(--pt);border-radius:1px;}

  .panel{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;padding:14px 16px;background:#fff;
         display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-height:0;}
  .panel.fill{flex:1 1 auto;}

  /* ---------- KPI cards ---------- */
  .kpis{display:grid;gap:11px;}
  .kpi{border:1px solid var(--line);border-top:3px solid var(--pt);border-radius:5px;
       padding:11px 13px;background:#fff;}
  .kpi .lb{font-size:10.5px;color:var(--ink2);margin-bottom:5px;letter-spacing:-.2px;}
  .kpi .vl{font-size:29px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;color:var(--pt);letter-spacing:-1px;}
  .kpi .vl small{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin-left:2px;}
  .kpi .nt{font-size:10px;color:var(--ink3);margin-top:5px;}
  .kpi.blue{border-top-color:var(--blue);} .kpi.blue .vl{color:var(--blue);}
  .kpi.dark{border-top-color:#4A4A4A;} .kpi.dark .vl{color:var(--ink);}
  .kpi.green{border-top-color:var(--green);} .kpi.green .vl{color:var(--green);}
  .kpi.amber{border-top-color:var(--amber);} .kpi.amber .vl{color:var(--amber);}

  /* ---------- tables ---------- */
  table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:11.5px;}
  thead th{background:var(--pt);color:#fff;font-weight:700;padding:7px 9px;text-align:left;
           font-size:11px;letter-spacing:-.2px;}
  tbody td{padding:6.5px 9px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--ink2);}
  tbody tr:nth-child(even){background:#FAFAFA;}
  tbody td:first-child{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600;}
  td.n{text-align:center;}
  .up{color:var(--pt);font-weight:700;}
  .dn{color:var(--green);font-weight:700;}
  .wr{color:var(--amber);font-weight:700;}
  tr.hi td{background:var(--pt-soft)!important;}

  /* ---------- factor cards ---------- */
  .fc{border:1px solid var(--line);border-left:4px solid var(--pt);border-radius:5px;
      padding:12px 14px;background:#FCFCFC;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px;}
  .fc.b{border-left-color:var(--amber);} .fc.c{border-left-color:var(--blue);}
  .fc.d{border-left-color:var(--ink3);}
  .fc .ti{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:var(--pt);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;}
  .fc.b .ti{color:var(--amber);} .fc.c .ti{color:var(--blue);} .fc.d .ti{color:var(--ink2);}
  .fc .num{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
           width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--pt);color:#fff;
           font-size:11px;font-weight:700;flex:0 0 auto;}
  .fc.b .num{background:var(--amber);} .fc.c .num{background:var(--blue);} .fc.d .num{background:var(--ink3);}
  ul.bl{list-style:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;}
  ul.bl li{font-size:11px;color:var(--ink2);line-height:1.5;padding-left:11px;position:relative;letter-spacing:-.2px;}
  ul.bl li::before{content:"–";position:absolute;left:0;color:var(--ink3);}
  ul.bl li b{color:var(--pt);font-weight:700;}

  /* ---------- request list ---------- */
  .rq{display:flex;gap:11px;align-items:flex-start;padding:9px 0;border-bottom:1px dashed var(--line);}
  .rq:last-child{border-bottom:none;}
  .tag{flex:0 0 auto;background:var(--pt);color:#fff;font-size:9.5px;font-weight:700;
       padding:3.5px 8px;border-radius:3px;letter-spacing:.3px;margin-top:1px;min-width:48px;text-align:center;}
  .tag.w{background:#8A8A8A;}
  .rq .ct .h{font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:4px;}

  /* ---------- timeline ---------- */
  .tl{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:11px;}
  .tl .st{border-radius:5px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid var(--line);
          display:flex;flex-direction:column;}
  .tl .st .hh{background:var(--pt);color:#fff;padding:8px 11px;}
  .tl .st:nth-child(2) .hh{background:#D64B6B;}
  .tl .st:nth-child(3) .hh{background:var(--blue);}
  .tl .st:nth-child(4) .hh{background:var(--green);}
  .tl .st .hh .a{font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700;}
  .tl .st .hh .b{font-size:10px;opacity:.85;}
  .tl .st .bb{padding:10px 11px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;flex:1;}
  .tl .st .bb div{font-size:10.5px;color:var(--ink2);line-height:1.45;letter-spacing:-.3px;}

  /* ---------- effect ---------- */
  .ef{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:10px;}
  .ef .e{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:5px;padding:10px;text-align:center;background:#FCFCFC;}
  .ef .e .k{font-size:10px;color:var(--ink2);margin-bottom:6px;}
  .ef .e .p{font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:var(--pt);}
  .ef .e .ar{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink3);margin:2px 0;}
  .ef .e .q{font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:var(--green);}

  .concl{background:var(--pt-soft);border-left:4px solid var(--pt);border-radius:4px;
         padding:13px 16px;font-size:11.5px;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.65;letter-spacing:-.2px;}
  .concl b{color:var(--pt);}

  /* ---------- cover ---------- */
  .cover{padding:0;justify-content:center;}
  .cover .in{padding:0 76px;}
  .cover .bar{width:64px;height:5px;background:var(--pt);margin-bottom:22px;}
  .cover h1{font-size:46px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-1.6px;line-height:1.2;}
  .cover h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--pt);}
  .cover .p{font-size:15px;color:var(--ink2);margin-top:14px;letter-spacing:-.3px;}
  .cover .facts{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:0;margin-top:34px;
                border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);}
  .cover .facts div{padding:15px 14px 15px 0;}
  .cover .facts div+div{padding-left:18px;border-left:1px solid var(--line);}
  .cover .facts .k{font-size:10px;color:var(--ink3);letter-spacing:1px;margin-bottom:6px;}
  .cover .facts .v{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink);letter-spacing:-.3px;}
  .cover .foot{margin-top:26px;font-size:11.5px;color:var(--ink3);}

  /* ---------- legend / chart ---------- */
  .lg{display:flex;gap:14px;justify-content:center;margin-top:6px;}
  .lg span{font-size:10.5px;color:var(--ink2);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;}
  .lg i{width:11px;height:3px;border-radius:2px;display:inline-block;}
  .chart{flex:1 1 auto;min-height:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;}
  .chart svg{width:100%;height:100%;display:block;}

  .note{font-size:10px;color:var(--ink3);margin-top:7px;letter-spacing:-.2px;}

  /* ---------- chrome ---------- */
  #bar{position:absolute;left:0;bottom:0;height:3px;background:var(--pt);width:0;
       transition:width .3s ease;z-index:5;}
  .pg{position:absolute;right:46px;bottom:16px;font-size:10.5px;color:var(--ink3);letter-spacing:1px;}
  .brand{position:absolute;left:46px;bottom:16px;font-size:9.5px;color:#CFCFCF;letter-spacing:1.5px;}
  #nav{position:fixed;bottom:16px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);
       display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;z-index:20;
       background:rgba(255,255,255,.94);border:1px solid #DDD;border-radius:30px;
       padding:6px 12px;box-shadow:0 3px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.12);}
  #nav button{border:none;background:var(--pt);color:#fff;width:26px;height:26px;
              border-radius:50%;cursor:pointer;font-size:13px;line-height:1;}
  #nav button:disabled{background:#DDD;cursor:default;}
  #nav .ct{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--ink2);min-width:52px;text-align:center;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;}
  #hint{position:fixed;top:14px;right:16px;font-size:10.5px;color:#AAA;z-index:20;}
  @media print{#nav,#hint{display:none;}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div id="viewport">
  <div id="stage">

  <!-- ================= 1 : COVER ================= -->
  <section class="slide cover active">
    <div class="in">
      <div class="bar"></div>
      <h1>SAV → HSV 내륙운송<br><em>L/T 분석 보고</em></h1>
      <div class="p">Savannah Port ATA → Huntsville(HSV) FDEST 입고 구간 리드타임 진단 및 개선 방안</div>
      <div class="facts">
        <div><div class="k">대상</div><div class="v">FCL SAV<br>TL Mode</div></div>
        <div><div class="k">분석 기간</div><div class="v">2025.02 ~ 2026.07<br>(18개월)</div></div>
        <div><div class="k">분석 건수</div><div class="v">1,121건<br>(DELIVERED 기준)</div></div>
        <div><div class="k">내륙 CARRIER</div><div class="v">FNS<br>(Single Vendor)</div></div>
        <div><div class="k">총 INLAND L/T</div><div class="v">평균 9.97일<br>(목표 ≤ 10일)</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="foot">부품기획팀 &nbsp;|&nbsp; 2026.07 &nbsp;|&nbsp; LGE Internal Use Only</div>
    </div>
    <div class="pg">01 / 08</div>
    <div id="bar"></div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================= 2 : 현황 요약 ================= -->
  <section class="slide">
    <div class="hd">
      <div><div class="eyebrow">OVERVIEW</div><h1>구간 L/T 현황 <span class="sub">요약</span></h1></div>
      <div class="meta">부품기획팀 | 2026.07</div>
    </div>
    <div class="body">
      <div class="kpis" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);margin-bottom:16px;">
        <div class="kpi blue"><div class="lb">Port→Drayage 평균 L/T</div><div class="vl">3.8<small>일</small></div><div class="nt">CV 44.6%</div></div>
        <div class="kpi"><div class="lb">FNS TL L/T 전체 평균</div><div class="vl">4.8<small>일</small></div><div class="nt">CV 97.2% · 핵심 병목</div></div>
        <div class="kpi blue"><div class="lb">T/L→Delivery 평균</div><div class="vl">1.3<small>일</small></div><div class="nt">SAV→HSV ≈ 330mi</div></div>
        <div class="kpi dark"><div class="lb">총 Inland L/T 평균</div><div class="vl">9.97<small>일</small></div><div class="nt">Max 34일 · 목표 ≤10일</div></div>
        <div class="kpi"><div class="lb">2026.05~06 TL L/T</div><div class="vl">12.9<small>일</small></div><div class="nt">이상 급등 구간</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="cols c-2a" style="height:calc(100% - 116px);">
        <div class="panel fill">
          <div class="sec-t">월별 TL L/T 추이 (2025.02 ~ 2026.07)</div>
          <div class="chart" id="ch-line"></div>
          <div class="lg">
            <span><i style="background:#C10933"></i>TL L/T (FNS 대기)</span>
            <span><i style="background:#1A4F8A"></i>Port→Drayage L/T</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="panel fill">
          <div class="sec-t">기간별 TL L/T 요약</div>
          <table>
            <thead><tr><th>기간</th><th class="n">평균</th><th class="n">Max</th><th class="n">이상비율</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr><td>2025.02–03</td><td class="n">2~3일</td><td class="n">6일</td><td class="n">0%</td></tr>
              <tr><td>2025.04–12</td><td class="n">2~4일</td><td class="n">12일</td><td class="n">0~4%</td></tr>
              <tr><td>2026.01–03</td><td class="n">2~3일</td><td class="n">5일</td><td class="n">0%</td></tr>
              <tr class="hi"><td>2026.04 ▲</td><td class="n up">6.2일</td><td class="n up">14일</td><td class="n up">10%</td></tr>
              <tr class="hi"><td>2026.05 ▲▲</td><td class="n up">14.8일</td><td class="n up">27일</td><td class="n up">86%</td></tr>
              <tr class="hi"><td>2026.06 ▲</td><td class="n up">11.0일</td><td class="n up">18일</td><td class="n up">51%</td></tr>
              <tr><td>2026.07 ▼</td><td class="n dn">2.6일</td><td class="n dn">5일</td><td class="n dn">0%</td></tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
          <div class="note">※ 이상비율 = TL L/T 10일 초과 건 비중</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="brand">LGE INTERNAL USE ONLY</div><div class="pg">02 / 08</div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================= 3 : 구간별 분해 ================= -->
  <section class="slide">
    <div class="hd">
      <div><div class="eyebrow">SEGMENT BREAKDOWN</div><h1>구간별 L/T 분해 및 <span class="sub">불안정성 비교</span></h1></div>
      <div class="meta">부품기획팀 | 2026.07</div>
    </div>
    <div class="body">
      <div class="cols c-2">
        <div class="panel fill">
          <div class="sec-t">구간별 L/T 기여도 (월별 누적, 일)</div>
          <div class="chart" id="ch-stack"></div>
          <div class="lg">
            <span><i style="background:#1A4F8A"></i>Port→Drayage</span>
            <span><i style="background:#C10933"></i>FNS TL L/T</span>
            <span><i style="background:#E8A9B8"></i>T/L→Delivery</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="stack">
          <div class="panel">
            <div class="sec-t">구간별 변동계수(CV%) — 불안정성 비교</div>
            <table>
              <thead><tr><th>구간</th><th class="n">현재 CV%</th><th>평가</th><th class="n">우선순위</th></tr></thead>
              <tbody>
                <tr><td>Discharge L/T</td><td class="n">165.1%</td><td>단기 체선·통관 영향</td><td class="n">3순위</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Port→Drayage</td><td class="n">44.6%</td><td>항만 혼잡 연동</td><td class="n">2순위</td></tr>
                <tr class="hi"><td>FNS TL L/T</td><td class="n up">97.2%</td><td><b>핵심 병목</b></td><td class="n up">1순위</td></tr>
                <tr><td>T/L→Delivery</td><td class="n">62.8%</td><td>드라이버 가용성</td><td class="n">4순위</td></tr>
                <tr><td>총 Inland L/T</td><td class="n">53.9%</td><td>종합 변동</td><td class="n">—</td></tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
          <div class="panel fill">
            <div class="sec-t">진단 요지</div>
            <ul class="bl" style="gap:7px;">
              <li>Discharge CV가 가장 높으나 절대 소요일이 짧아 총 L/T 영향은 제한적이며, <b>FNS TL 구간이 절대값·변동성 모두 최상위</b>인 유일한 구간</li>
              <li>Port→Drayage(3.84일)는 Savannah GPA 혼잡이라는 <b>외생 변수</b>로 통제 여지가 제한적</li>
              <li>T/L→Delivery는 1.3일로 안정적 — <b>운송 거리(≈330mi) 자체는 문제가 아님</b></li>
              <li>결론: 총 Inland L/T 9.97일 중 개선 여지가 가장 큰 지점은 <b>Drayage 완료 후 트럭 배차 대기 시간</b></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="brand">LGE INTERNAL USE ONLY</div><div class="pg">03 / 08</div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================= 4 : 변동 요인 ================= -->
  <section class="slide">
    <div class="hd">
      <div><div class="eyebrow">ROOT CAUSE</div><h1>L/T 변동 <span class="sub">핵심 요인 4</span></h1></div>
      <div class="meta">부품기획팀 | 2026.07</div>
    </div>
    <div class="body">
      <div class="cols c-2" style="grid-template-rows:1fr 1fr;">
        <div class="fc">
          <div class="ti"><span class="num">1</span>FNS 배차 수 제한 <span style="font-size:10px;background:var(--pt);color:#fff;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:10px;">최대 원인</span></div>
          <ul class="bl">
            <li>2026.05 TL L/T <b>14.8일</b> → Drayage 완료 후 트럭 미배차 대기 장기화</li>
            <li>동일 T/L 날짜 최대 13대 → 초과분 다음 주로 이월 (주 1~2회 배차)</li>
            <li>2026.07 즉시 <b>2.6일</b>로 정상화 → AI 창고담당자 협의(입고량 통제) 후 배차 제한 정황</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="fc b">
          <div class="ti"><span class="num">2</span>Port 체류 증가 <span style="font-size:10px;background:var(--amber);color:#fff;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:10px;">선행 지표</span></div>
          <ul class="bl">
            <li>Port→Drayage 평균 3.84일, CV 44.6% → Savannah GPA 물량 급증과 연동</li>
            <li>Port 체류↑ → Drayage 지연 → FNS T/L 큐 누적으로 <b>연쇄 악화</b></li>
            <li>내부 통제 불가 요인으로, 조기 경보 지표로 활용 필요</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="fc c">
          <div class="ti"><span class="num">3</span>요일 집중 배치 패턴</div>
          <ul class="bl">
            <li>Drayage 집중: 화 256건 &gt; 수 244건 &gt; 월 212건</li>
            <li>금요일 배차 회피(144건) → <b>목~월 대기 가산</b></li>
